  "body": "As a first step for https://github.com/w3c/webcomponents/issues/187 (adding customizable form data for custom elements), we decided at TPAC 2016 that we should refactor [constructing the form data set](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/forms.html#constructing-the-form-data-set) by having it call out to each element (probably also each input type), instead of having it be a big switch statement inlined into the algorithm. This will help us illuminate the general requirements for what custom elements will need.\n",
